id=determination-kernel-install
name=Determination kernel installer (action zip)
version=v0.2.0
versionCode=2
author=melissa
description=Flashes the Magisk-patched Determination boot image to the active boot slot, with exact-build + root-survival + backup verification and a dry-run flag (touch /sdcard/Download/determination-dryrun). Does not install as a module.
